	(text "AP triggers the timer:\n	AP turns Q3 → discharges the RC node made by R48 & C31\n\nWhile AP is HIGH:\n	RC node is held LOW\n	Comparator - input stays below its threshold\n	Comparator output releases HIGH\n	Reset goes HIGH\n\nWhen AP goes LOW:\n	Q3 turns off\n	C31 recharges through R48\n	Once RC node rises above the comparator threshold, Reset goes LOW again\n\nLIF AdEx model:\n	After threshold crossing, create a refractory/reset window.\n	This defines the time interval after the spile during which\n	reset can act to bring the membrane back toward V_reset"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 349.25 370.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "16ecdd00-485b-4f19-9602-9a6b747c5e31")
	)
