	(text "R_Leak = RV2 + R30\nI_Leak ​= (V_Leak - Vm) / R_Leak \nStronger leak → Faster return of Vm_Int toward V_leak\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 268.605 162.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "1d5f61cd-1c85-4394-a2b1-468585d73641")
	)
	(text "AP creates a short spike pulse:\n	AP is AC-coupled through C29\n	Only the rising edge is passed by D8\n	This creates a short positive Spike_Pulse\n\nSpike_Pulse opens the peak window:\n	Comparator compares Spike_Pulse to V_Peak_Threshold\n	While Spike_Pulse is above threshold, Peak_Window goes HIGH\n\nWhile Peak_Window is HIGH:\n	The analog switch closes\n	Buffered V_Peak_Ref is connected through R47 to Vm_Int\n	This injects a brief upward current into the membrane\n\nWhen Peak_Window goes LOW:\n	The analog switch opens again\n	Peak injection stops\n	The overshoot ends and the membrane can then be reset by the next block\n\nLIF AdEx model:\n	After threshold crossing, create a short spike-peak / overshoot event.\n	This briefly pushes the membrane toward a peak value\n	before the reset/refractory process brings it back toward V_reset."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 234.95 370.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1d783fd0-e049-4d28-a293-7b6d6c60ccaf")
	)
