	(text "Peak_Window is buffered and exported as a digital spike pulse:\n	A dedicated comparator channel regenerates the internal spike pulse\n	A stronger pull-up and series resistor make the signal suitable for transmission to another unit\n\nThis block outputs a clean high-true spike event referenced to GNDREF. It is intended for inter-unit coupling, where each spike is sent as a short digital pulse."
