	(text "Stimulus_Ext is converted into a local current command:  \n	The external analog stimulus is ESD-protected and lightly filtered intoV_Stim_Cmd  \n	V_Leak is used as the zero-current reference, \n	→ Commands above V_Leak are depolarising \n	→ Commands below V_Leak are hyperpolarising\n\nProduces an approximate current-clamp style stimulus current into the membrane"
