	(text "A difference amplifier senses when Vm_Int rises above V_Leak.\n	→ Produces a one-way charging drive into Vw.\n\nLIF AdEx model:\n	Approximates the continuous subthreshold adaptation term:\n	τ_w · dw/dt = a(V - E_L) - w"
