	(text "When Peak is LOW and Reset is HIGH:\n	Connect the buffered reset reference to the membrane \n    → Pull Vm_Int towards V_Reset_Ref\n\nLIF AdEx model:\n	After threshold crossing and spike peak (overshoot),\n	force the membrane toward V_reset during the refractory/reset window.\n"
