	(text "Vm_Int is compared to the threshold reference\n\nComparator hysteresis stabilises threshold crossing:\n\nOutput spike-state signal:\n	The comparator node is inverted by Q1\n	AP is LOW while Vm_Int is below threshold\n	AP goes HIGH when Vm_Int rises above threshold\n\nLIF AdEx model:\n	Implements the spike-trigger condition of the neuron.\n	When the membrane crosses threshold, this block declares the spike event\n	and drives the downstream peak, reset, and refractory logic."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 368.3 248.285 0)
		(effects
